203
00:14:54,110 --> 00:14:56,191
[SPEAKER_02]: And now, because you think... when...

204
00:14:57,071 --> 00:15:01,919
[SPEAKER_02]: Because you think that what you should or shouldn't do is defined by the letter, not by your intention.

205
00:15:03,361 --> 00:15:09,170
