218
00:16:18,484 --> 00:16:18,664
[SPEAKER_02]: Yeah.

219
00:16:18,804 --> 00:16:20,846
[SPEAKER_02]: The fault is when you act out of greed, aversion, delusion.

220
00:16:21,487 --> 00:16:25,371
