240
00:17:52,677 --> 00:17:53,917
[SPEAKER_02]: You acting out of hindrances.

241
00:17:55,825 --> 00:18:01,789
[SPEAKER_02]: You not being able to remain unmoved, even when you know... No, my intention was good.

242
00:18:02,469 --> 00:18:08,393
